<title>USA: Ugly Duckling buys used-car dealerships.</title>
<headline>Ugly Duckling buys used-car dealerships.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX, Ariz. 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ugly Duckling Corp on Thursday said it completed the purchase of certain assets of E-Z Plan Inc, a San Antionio, Texas-based car sales and finance company.</p>
<p>The total purchase price was $26.3 million, it said.</p>
<p>The assets purchased include seven used-car dealerships operating in San Antonio under the name &quot;Red McCombs EZ Motors,&quot; as well as vehicle inventory and a finance contract portfolio.</p>
